### Step 3: Compute the distance

The distance from $ u = (3, 5, 1, -1) $ to the span of $ \{v_1, v_2\} $ is given by:

$$
\text{dist}(u, \text{span}\{v_1, v_2\}) = \sqrt{(u - P u)^T (u - P u)}
$$

Compute $ u - P u $:

$$
